<db:section xml:id="details">
<db:title>Detailed Description</db:title>
<db:para>This class tests that QDoc doesn't emit spurious &quot;No such parameter&quot; warnings for auto-generated documentation when the parameter is unnamed in the source code.</db:para>
</db:section>
